  unitName: Autonomous Cotton
  unitId: 820158
  unitNumber: 8289
  description: A rabbit and machine hybrid from the mysterious world of Paskua that
    communicates through its special headpiece. Although Cotton was originally sent
    to Grand Gaia to collect the colorful eggs endowed with mystical powers, its
    master failed to foresee the impact that its experiences on this unfamiliar world
    would have on it. Had Cotton been able to declare its independence from its master,
    it may have decided to remain in Grand Gaia to enjoy its newfound freedom in
    its bountiful forests. However, this would have required some fundamental changes
    in its rationale that it could have not adapted completely on its own. Thus,
    it must have come in contact with someone or something quite powerful to have
    achieved full autonomy.
  summonDesc: STAY IN GRAND GAIA...EXTENDED.<br>OBJECTIVE...<br>mE...WaNT...<br>...AdVEnTuRE.
  fusionDesc: POWER CELLS REF...<br>H-HUN...hUnGrY...<br>C-CarRoT...pLeaSE...
